{"id":"3063825685","kind":"article","title":"第一卷：地图与领土","author":"Rob Bensinger","original_authors":["Rob Bensinger"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/Book-I-Map-And-Territory"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2024-11-18","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":28,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":460,"keywords":["信念","贝叶斯理性","证据","地图与领土"],"summary":"这段《偏见：序言》介绍“地图与领土”系列，探讨何为信念、为何有些信念更能指引现实，并提醒所谓理论未必能像地图一样准确导航。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/3063825685","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"A. 可以预见的错误"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"B. 虚假的信念"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"C. 注意到困惑"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"D. 神秘的答案"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"dQ-DPeTH\">什么是信念，而又是什么让有些信念比其它信念管用？这四个系列解释了贝叶斯概念下的理性，信念，以及证据。本书主题：有些被我们称之为「解释」或「理论」的东西并不总是能像地图一样导航世界。因此，我们心中的地图可能会有和我们工具箱里的其它东西搞混的风险。</p><p data-pid=\"_D0hsMy0\">——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Biases-An-Introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《偏见：序言》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup> by Rob Bensinger</p><hr/><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://hpmor.xyz/ai2zb_0/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">前言+导读 - 哈利波特与理性之道</a><h2 id=\"sec-1\"><b>A. 可以预见的错误</b></h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-8a9c29fa2f60e21a4dba126aafa937d7_qhd.jpg\" data-image-height=\"3264\" data-image-width=\"4896\" data-tm-id=\"3102093644\" href=\"#/post/3102093644\">Thoughts Memo：可以预见的错误</a><h2 id=\"sec-2\"><b>B. </b>虚假的信念</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-473130ab1b21c89cf0609c4cd48b3964_qhd.jpg\" data-image-height=\"3456\" data-image-width=\"5184\" data-tm-id=\"3102965185\" href=\"#/post/3102965185\">Thoughts Memo：虚假的信念</a><h2 id=\"sec-3\"><b>C. 注意到困惑</b></h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7915899377bda1786753d202cd49349d_qhd.jpg\" da